uffered by the entire Cam and Sabbat....and how exactly the mind numbling dull anarchs are actually super cool and we can only play them....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think the answer is pretty simple. the writers probably have a vision of their game that has the anarchs, somehow, being the cool good guys (I haven't seen anything up to this point that would qualify them for being either cool or good) and all the rest as evil and stupid assholes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-13T07:48:56-07:00","id":1478762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478581-new-vampire-the-masquerade-video-game?p=1478760#post1478760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Can you write without bashing an edition and playstyle? Please take a warning.</b></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> since I can't lie about the current state of the game, no, laters all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-13T07:54:43-07:00","id":1478763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478581-new-vampire-the-masquerade-video-game?p=1478759#post1478759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd love to see them try to explain the full frontal lobotomy suffered by the entire Cam and Sabbat....and how exactly the mind numbling dull anarchs are actually super cool and we can only play them....</div> </div> </div> </div>While I don't own the Sabbat book, I do own the Camarilla book, and the Cam are very much presented as an option for PCs. They're traditionalists and reactionaries, and they've made some stupid mistakes over the last two decades, but they're also competent enough to fix the parts of the mess they can and help protect kindred who join them. They've been pushed towards the kindred elite niche, but they've not been made complete incompetents or bastards (in fact their level of bastardry is mostly unchanged, they've just become a lot more exclusive).<br /> <br /> As for how the Anarchs are actually super cool, I think that's more an attempt to return to the early days of Vampire where the Anarchs were cool because they were the ones fighting the elitist and oppressive elders in the Camarilla. Sadly they were less cool than the Sabbat, and so V5 decided to put the Sabbat on the high self where only the ST is allowed to play with them. Then they went and tried to make the Anarchs into Diet Sabbat, which is to me less interesting than either their earlier implementation or the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> But I'm certain there are people who like the new Anarchs and Sabbat. That's fine, my Masquerade is a mashup of V20 and V5 lore anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}